OL,3,GNEWSAStalemate over burnt-out car near
OL,4,Awedding venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a wedding venue is
OL,7,Fpleading with police and the local
OL,8,Fauthority to get a burnt-out car that
OL,9,Fwas abandoned on her land nearly three
OL,10,Fmonths ago moved.
OL,12,FLiz Clapham reported the Land Rover as
OL,13,Fabandoned in Great Hatfield, near
OL,14,FHornsea, East Yorkshire, in June.
OL,16,FThe owner of the wedding venue and
OL,17,Fnearby holiday cottages said it was
OL,18,F"not a good look" for guests.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
