OL,3,GNEWSAStalemate over burnt-out car near
OL,4,Awedding venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FHumberside Police said the owner of the
OL,7,Fvehicle had been identified and the
OL,8,Fmatter had been passed on to the local
OL,9,Fauthority. But East Riding of Yorkshire
OL,10,FCouncil said that because the car was
OL,11,Fthe subject of an ongoing
OL,12,Finvestigation, it was a matter for the
OL,13,Fpolice.
